    "title": "Which former Central Chester County area high school athletes will be active on Saturday, Dec. 20?",
    "text": "On Saturday, Dec. 20, these former Central Chester County area high school standouts will be in action.\nAidan Langley Towson Tigers Forward Freshman 6′1″ Westtown School Hometown: Coatesville Next Game: vs. Lehigh Mountain Hawks, Saturday, Dec. 20, 12 p.m.\nCassie Denning Ursinus Bears Guard and forward Senior 5′10″ Downingtown East High School Hometown: Downingtown Next Game: vs. Fairleigh Dickinson Knights, Saturday, Dec. 20, 1 p.m.\nDereck Lively II Dallas Mavericks 7′1″ 230 Westtown School Hometown: Philadelphia Next Game: vs. Philadelphia 76ers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 6 p.m.\nJayden Kelsey Binghamton Bearcats Guard Freshman 6′7″ 210 Westtown School Hometown: Phoenixville Next Game: vs. Mercyhurst Lakers, Saturday, Dec. 20, 2 p.m.\nJayden Rowe York Spartans Guard Senior 6′4″ 210 Downingtown East High School Hometown: Downingtown Next Game: vs. Ursinus Bears, Saturday, Dec. 20, 4 p.m.",
